

**16.4. Calculation of the Jacobian Functions by Use of the Arithmetic-Geometric Mean (A.G.M.)**

For the A.G.M. scale see 17.6.

To calculate sn (_u_|_m_), cn (_u_|_m_), and dn (_u_|_m_) form the A.G.M. scale starting with

**16.4.1**: \(a_{0}\)=1, \(b_{0}\)=\(\sqrt{m}_{1}\), \(c_{0}\)=\(\sqrt{m}\), terminating at the step \(N\) when \(c_{N}\) is negligible to the accuracy required. Find \(\varphi_{N}\) in degrees where

**16.4.2**: \(\varphi_{N}\)=2\({}^{N}a_{N}u\)\(\frac{180^{n}}{\pi}\)

From these all the other functions can be determined.

**16.5. Special Arguments**

\begin{tabular}{l|l|l|l|l} \hline \hline  & \(u\) & sn u & cn \(u\) & dn \(u\) \\ \hline
**16.5.1**: & 0 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\
**16.5.2**: & \(\frac{1}{2}K\) & \(\frac{1}{(1+m^{(n)})^{1/n}}\) & \(\frac{m_{1}u^{1/n}}{(1+m^{(n)})^{1/n}}\) & \(m_{1}u^{1/n}\) \\
**16.5.3**: & \(K\) & 1 & 0 & \(m_{1}u^{1/n}\) \\
**16.5.4**: & \(\frac{1}{2}(iK^{\prime})\) & \(im^{-1/n}\) & \(\frac{(1+m^{(n)})^{1/n}}{m^{1/n}}\) & \((1+m^{(n)})^{1/n}\) \\
**16.5.5**: & \(\frac{1}{2}(K+iK^{\prime})\) & \(2^{-1/n}m^{-1/n}(1+m^{(n)})^{1/n}\) & \(+i(1-m^{(n)})^{1/n}\) & \(\left(\frac{m_{1}}{4}\right)^{i}\)\((1-i)\) & \(\left(\frac{m_{1}}{4}\right)^{i}\)\((1+m_{1}u_{1})^{1/n}\) \\
**16.5.6**: & \(K+\frac{1}{2}(iK^{\prime})\) & \(m^{-1/n}\) & \(-i\left(\frac{1-m^{(n)}}{m^{1/n}}\right)^{1/n}\) & \((1-m^{(n)})^{1/n}\) \\
**16.5.7**: & \(iK^{\prime}\) & \(\infty\) & \(\infty\) & \(\infty\) \\
**16.5.8**: & \(\frac{1}{2}K+iK^{\prime}\) & \((1-m^{(n)})^{-1/n}\) & \(-i\left(\frac{m_{1}u^{1/n}}{1-m^{(n)}}\right)^{1/n}\) & \(-im_{1}u^{1/n}\) \\
**16.5.9**: & \(K+iK^{\prime}\) & \(m^{-1/n}\) & \(-i(m_{1}/m)^{1/n}\) & 0 \\ \hline \hline \end{tabular}

